{{slim-wikipedia|Pericles (disambiguation)}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[Perikles]], [[Periklis]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|Pericles|Periclēs|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|Περικλῆς||far-famed|tr=Periklēs|lang=grc}}, from {{term|περί||around|tr=peri|lang=grc}} + {{term|κλέος||glory|tr=kleos|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|pērīklĕs}}
* {{IPA|/ˈpɛrɪkliːz/|lang=en}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[Greek]] [[politician]] that lived during the ancient and the classical times.
# {{given name|male|from=Ancient Greek}} of mostly [[historical]] use.

